  "intro": {
    "text": "`-lYk` makes nouns: *dost* → *dostluk*, friendship; *ýalňyş* → *ýalňyşlyk*, mistake; *sag* → *saglyk*, health. The *k* becomes *g* before a vowel: *dostlugymyz*, our friendship. `-çA` names a language and says **in** it: *rusça*, *nemesçe*; *meniň pikirimçe*, in my opinion.",
    "see": "gp-lyk"
  },
